    "title": "Bear Thoroughly Enjoys Nectar From Hummingbird Feeder (Video) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bethanie H ,\n11 hours ago Stock image by Ennui Captured / 500px/Getty Images Jim Lawrence from Asheville, North Carolina, recently shared close-up footage from his backyard of a bear thoroughly enjoying nectar from his hummingbird feeder. In the video, you can see the bear lapping up the sweet liquid as it grasps onto the feeder with its nectar-soaked claws. Eventually, it pulls too hard and the feeder comes crashing down.\n[RELATED: WATCH: Baby Bear Slips Through Patio Fence in Montana ]\n“Silly bear, bird feeders aren’t for bears!” wrote WLOS News in an Instagram post sharing Lawrence’s video.\nWatch a bear enjoying nectar from a hummingbird feeder below (or see it here ).\nHeader stock image by Ennui Captured / 500px/Getty Images",
    "summary": "11 hours ago Stock image by Ennui Captured / 500px/Getty Images Jim Lawrence from Asheville, North Carolina, recently shared close-up footage from his backyard of a bear thoroughly enjoying nectar from his hummingbird feeder. In the video, you can see the bear lapping up the sweet liquid as it grasps onto the feeder with its nectar-soaked claws. Eventually, it pulls too hard and the feeder comes crashing down. [RELATED: WATCH: Baby Bear Slips Through Patio Fence in Montana ] “Silly bear, bird feeders aren’t for bears!” wrote WLOS News in an Instagram post sharing Lawrence’s video.",
